=== PE 833: Square Triangle Products ===

Counting products of square × triangular ≤ N:

N =       1000 → count=     146, sum(mod 1000000007)=57928
N =      10000 → count=     615, sum(mod 1000000007)=2348406
N =     100000 → count=    2447, sum(mod 1000000007)=91307881
N =    1000000 → count=    9338, sum(mod 1000000007)=422139139

=== Asymptotic Analysis ===
For each triangular t = k(k+1)/2 ~ k^2/2:
  #squares ≤ N/t ≈ √(N/t) ≈ √(2N)/k
  Total ≈ Σ_{k≤√(2N)} √(2N)/k ≈ √(2N) · H_{√(2N)}
  ~ √(2N) · ln(√(2N)) = O(√N log N)

Growth rate check:
  N=10000: count=615, ~√N·ln√N ≈ 700
  N=100000: count=2447, ~√N·ln√N ≈ 2729
  N=1000000: count=9338, ~√N·ln√N ≈ 10259

PE answer: 43884302
